 "_about": [
  "How tools/import-items.py sorts every workbook item into one KIND and one SUB-CATEGORY.",
  "The tracker uses the kind everywhere: Items tab chips, inventory rows, Tracker card and sheet sections, the homebrew form.",
  "Order of decisions: 'names' (exact item name) first, then 'rules' top to bottom; the first rule that matches wins.",
  "A rule's conditions all have to hold: g = workbook group, c = workbook sheet, name / f = regular expression on the name / features (case-insensitive),",
  "soakMax / soakMin / defMax / defMin = armour numbers. 'bag' marks items whose features say they add carrying capacity.",
  "Edit freely, then run:  python3 tools/import-items.py --restamp   (or re-import the workbook)."
